pluginstrument.description:
Shows the current outside temperature and warns on icing conditions. Icing warning is triggered between -12 and 10 degrees Celsius.
Not a specific Baron B58 instrument, but fits the Baron Panel set layout
@screen size 1440 x 900 for a full screen panel, the geometry can be set to: (x, y, w, h) 0, 160, 160, 160
